    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks. it just feels less like \"burnout\" and more like i'm just fundamentally broken. like, no matter how much i sleep or how much i try to reorganize my life, the weight doesn't go away. it's just this constant, crushing pressure. i look at my bank account or my inbox and i just feel paralyzed. i feel like i'm just waiting for the moment everything finally collapses.",
