      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "Yes, it is possible to find peace, but it only happens when you stop trying to fix the broken pieces and instead focus on simply existing in the present moment without judgment. The cycle doesn't end by fixing the debt or the work; it ends when you stop believing that your worth is tied to your productivity or your ability to control everything. You don't need to stop everything entirely to find peace; you just need to stop fighting the weight and allow yourself to rest without guilt.",
